OL,3,GNEWSAControversial EV charger plans
OL,4,Aprompt parking fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to install new electric vehicle
OL,7,F(EV) charging points across Oxfordshire
OL,8,Fhave been met with concerns over their
OL,9,Fimpact on parking.
OL,11,FBampton, Burford, Eynsham and
OL,12,FShrivenham are among the places
OL,13,Fincluded in Oxfordshire County
OL,14,FCouncil's plans for new charging
OL,15,Fpoints.
OL,17,FWith the sale of new petrol and diesel
OL,18,Fcars due to end in 2030, the council
OL,19,Fsaid it wanted "to make it easier for
OL,20,Fpeople to switch to an electric
OL,21,Fvehicle".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
